            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Jarvis 0.19.17</h2>
<ul>
  <li>A task you already answered no longer comes back. Jarvis now rereads the
      conversation behind each task before deciding it is still open, and
      leaves it closed when your last message hands the next step to someone else.</li>
  <li>Settings → Meetings is now Meeting Notes: simpler cards, always on, and it
      only speaks up when something needs fixing.</li>
  <li>The app icon is rounded on macOS 14 and 15 instead of a black square.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
